### Get all shipments
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shipments

### Get tracking history for shipment 1
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1/tracking

### Add tracking event
POST http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1/tracking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}

### Get all shipments
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shipments

### Get shipment by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1

### Update shipment status
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1/status?status=OUT_FOR_DELIVERY

### Assign customer to shipment
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1
}

### Add tracking event
POST http://localhost:8081/api/shipments/1/tracking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY"
}